# Structure and Naming Rules

## Where code lives

- **Domain features:** `src/modules/{domain}/`
  - `controllers/` — HTTP (public, account, platform-admin prefixes)
  - `application/commands/` — mutations
  - `application/queries/` — reads / list DTOs
  - `domain/` — entities, enums, policies
  - `repositories/` — only Drizzle access
  - `dto/`, `mappers/`
- **Infrastructure:** `src/libs/` (config, guards, response — no domain rules)
- **Schema:** `src/_db/drizzle/schema/{domain}/` — repos in owning module only

## Domains

`identity`, `oauth`, `session`, `platform-admin`, `audit`

## Naming

- `*.controller.ts`, `*.module.ts`
- Commands: `register-user.command.ts`, `revoke-session.command.ts`
- Queries: `get-user-by-id.query.ts`, `list-oauth-clients.query.ts`
- `dto/*.dto.ts`
- Repositories: `{aggregate}.repository.ts`

## Reuse

Reuse existing helpers in `src/libs/` before creating duplicates.
